    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Concord & Portsmouth RR (Sunacook section)]]></name>
      <description>K4. This section of the line between Candia and Sunacook lasted only 10 years before being superceded by the line through Manchester. It was abandoned in 1862 long before the first available historical topo map so much of this is approximate.</description>
